### P2-ML-03: Quality Gate on Training Export

**Problem:** Fine-tune export includes incomplete and low-quality records.

**Solution:** Add quality filter to `GET /training/export`:

```python
QUALITY_GATES = {
    "min_confidence": 50,           # exclude low-confidence signals
    "exclude_regimes": ["UNKNOWN"], # exclude data-failure signals
    "require_outcome": True,        # exclude pending outcomes
    "min_sizing_multiplier": 0.5,   # exclude 0x-sized (blocked) signals
}
```

Add `?quality=strict` query param to apply gates. Default export includes all records (backward compat).

